{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17341","headline":"朔旦冬至摄职南郊因书即事 · 权德舆","name":"朔旦冬至摄职南郊因书即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大明南至庆天正，朔旦圆丘乐六成。\n文轨尽同尧历象，斋祠忝备汉公卿。\n星辰列位祥光满，金石交音晓奏清。\n更有观台称贺处，黄云捧日瑞昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}